        "raw": "<p>Hey everyone! It turns out that not only will I be at Essen, but we'll have six tables in the Pegasus booth to demo Spirit Island! They are going to be releasing the German version of the game at the show, so 4 tables will be for German, and 2 for English. I'll be at the show along with Maggie, SaRae, and Matt. Matt will be doing English language Spirit Island demos, but we could still use 3 or 4 more English-language demoers, as well as 6 or so German-language demoers, so if you or anyone you know would like to attend the show, demo some games, and get a cool Exhibitor badge and GTG T-shirt and lanyard, let me know!</p>",
